<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no, viewport-fit=cover">
  <title>Newton's Lobby — The Campus OS & AI Trust Layer</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Decentralized Campus OS, 0G Private Computer ZK AI Inference, World ID 4.0 Verification, Arkiv Network DB-Chain, and Swarm Storage.">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'><text y='.9em' font-size='90'>🌌</text></svg>">

  <style>
    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       NEWTON'S LOBBY — 120FPS DARK GLASS DESIGN SYSTEM
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    :root {
      --bg-obsidian: #0D1117;
      --bg-darker: #070A0F;
      --bg-card: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.75);
      --bg-card-hover: rgba(26, 36, 56, 0.9);
      --border-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      --border-glass-bright: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4);

      /* Neon Brand Accents */
      --c-cyan: #06B6D4;
      --c-cyan-glow: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.45);
      --c-magenta: #EC4899;
      --c-magenta-glow: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.45);
      --c-lime: #84CC16;
      --c-lime-glow: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.4);
      --c-gold: #F59E0B;
      --c-gold-glow: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.45);
      --c-purple: #8B5CF6;

      --c-text-primary: #F8FAFC;
      --c-text-secondary: #94A3B8;
      --c-text-muted: #64748B;

      --radius-sm: 8px;
      --radius-md: 14px;
      --radius-lg: 20px;
      --radius-full: 9999px;

      --shadow-cyan: 0 0 25px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25);
      --shadow-magenta: 0 0 25px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.25);
      --shadow-dark: 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);

      --font-sans: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Plus Jakarta Sans", Inter, sans-serif;
      --font-mono: "JetBrains Mono", "SFMono-Regular", Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    }

    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    html, body {
      background-color: var(--bg-obsidian);
      color: var(--c-text-primary);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* Ambient animated particle canvas */
    #ambient-canvas {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
      opacity: 0.65;
    }

    .app-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* Custom Scrollbar */
    ::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 6px; height: 6px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track { background: var(--bg-obsidian); }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 999px; }
    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover { background: var(--c-cyan); }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       TOAST NOTIFICATION ENGINE (Replaces ugly alert() popups)
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    #toast-container {
      position: fixed;
      top: 1.25rem;
      right: 1.25rem;
      z-index: 99999;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      pointer-events: none;
      max-width: 380px;
      width: calc(100vw - 2.5rem);
    }

    .cyber-toast {
      pointer-events: auto;
      background: rgba(14, 20, 32, 0.95);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass-bright);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.15rem;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), var(--shadow-cyan);
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      animation: toastIn 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .cyber-toast.toast-error {
      border-color: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), 0 0 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.3);
    }

    .cyber-toast.toast-success {
      border-color: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.5);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85), 0 0 20px rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.3);
    }

    @keyframes toastIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(40px) scale(0.95); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0) scale(1); }
    }

    @keyframes toastOut {
      from { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0) scale(1); }
      to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(40px) scale(0.95); }
    }

    .toast-icon {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .toast-content {
      flex: 1;
    }

    .toast-title {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .toast-message {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       NAVIGATION BAR
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .navbar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      width: 100%;
      z-index: 1000;
      backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(200%);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(200%);
      background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.88);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
      transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    .app-wrapper {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding-top: 76px;
    }

    .nav-brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .brand-logo-glow {
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), var(--c-magenta));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .brand-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .nav-tabs {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);
      padding: 0.3rem 0.4rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
    }

    .nav-tab-btn {
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.5rem 0.95rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-tab-btn:hover {
      color: #fff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }

    .nav-tab-btn.active {
      color: #fff;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25), rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2));
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass-bright);
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    }

    .nav-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .audio-toggle-btn {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .audio-toggle-btn:hover {
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      border-color: var(--c-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    .connect-world-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284C7, #06B6D4);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.15rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--c-cyan-glow);
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    .connect-world-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.6);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #06B6D4, #EC4899);
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION CONTAINERS & TAB SWITCHING
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .tab-section {
      display: none;
      animation: fadeIn 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem 5rem;
      max-width: 1320px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      width: 100%;
    }

    .tab-section.active {
      display: block;
    }

    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 1: HERO & AGENTIC DASHBOARD
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .hero-container {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 3rem 1rem 2.5rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
    }

    .pulse-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--c-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--c-cyan);
      animation: pulse 1.5s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 0.4; transform: scale(1.3); }
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 5.5vw, 3.8rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.15;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFFFF 30%, #94A3B8 70%, var(--c-cyan) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .hero-highlight {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), var(--c-magenta));
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.3);
    }

    .hero-subtitle {
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 0 auto 2.2rem;
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    /* Live Web3 Status Badges */
    .web3-badges-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1.15rem;
      max-width: 1220px;
      margin: 0 auto 2.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .web3-badges-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 580px) {
      .web3-badges-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .web3-badge-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
      text-align: left;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .web3-badge-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 3px;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--c-cyan);
    }

    .web3-badge-card.card-magenta::before { background: var(--c-magenta); }
    .web3-badge-card.card-lime::before { background: var(--c-lime); }
    .web3-badge-card.card-gold::before { background: var(--c-gold); }

    .web3-badge-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: var(--border-glass-bright);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-cyan);
    }

    .badge-card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 0.45rem;
    }

    .badge-icon-title {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .status-tag {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .status-tag.verified {
      background: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.15);
      color: var(--c-lime);
      border: 1px solid rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.35);
    }

    .status-tag.live {
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.35);
    }

    .status-tag.active {
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15);
      color: var(--c-gold);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
    }

    .badge-card-detail {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
    }

    /* Hero Action Buttons */
    .hero-btn-group {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.8rem;
    }

    .cta-btn {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.8rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .cta-btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), #0284C7);
      color: #030712;
      font-weight: 800;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    .cta-btn-primary:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.6);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22D3EE, var(--c-cyan));
    }

    .cta-btn-apk {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15), rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.05));
      border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.4);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .cta-btn-apk:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.25);
      border-color: var(--c-magenta);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-magenta);
    }

    .cta-btn-world {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .cta-btn-world:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-color: var(--c-lime);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-lime-glow);
    }

    /* Real-Time Campus Telemetry HUD Cards */
    .telemetry-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1.25rem;
      max-width: 1180px;
      margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .telemetry-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }

    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      .telemetry-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .telemetry-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.6rem 1.25rem;
      text-align: center;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    .telemetry-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-glass-bright);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    .telemetry-icon {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }

    .telemetry-value {
      font-size: 2.35rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      color: #fff;
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    }

    .telemetry-card:nth-child(1) .telemetry-value { color: var(--c-cyan); text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-cyan-glow); }
    .telemetry-card:nth-child(2) .telemetry-value { color: var(--c-lime); text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-lime-glow); }
    .telemetry-card:nth-child(3) .telemetry-value { color: var(--c-magenta); text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-magenta-glow); }
    .telemetry-card:nth-child(4) .telemetry-value { color: var(--c-gold); text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-gold-glow); }

    .telemetry-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .lobby-section-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.4), rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.4), transparent);
      margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
    }

    /* Campus Operating System Lobby (Squads & Builders) */
    .lobby-header-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      padding-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .lobby-subnav-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .subnav-pill {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .subnav-pill.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25), rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.25));
      border-color: var(--c-cyan);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    .squads-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(360px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.4rem;
    }

    .squad-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.4rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.9rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    .squad-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-glass-bright);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    .squad-top-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .squad-name {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .squad-hackathon-tag {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--c-gold);
      background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.35);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .squad-desc {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .squad-members-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .squad-members-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .squad-roster-meter {
      height: 6px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .squad-meter-fill {
      height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-cyan), var(--c-lime));
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .squad-avatar-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      margin-top: 0.25rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .member-avatar-chip {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      padding: 0.25rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: #fff;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.3rem;
    }

    .squad-actions-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 0.6rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
    }

    .squad-join-btn {
      flex: 1;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), #0284C7);
      color: #030712;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      padding: 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .squad-join-btn:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-cyan-glow);
      background: #22D3EE;
    }

    /* Builders List View */
    .builders-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.3rem;
    }

    .builder-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.35rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .builder-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--c-magenta);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
    }

    .builder-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .builder-avatar {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), var(--c-magenta));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1.6rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    .builder-name {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .builder-college {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .builder-meta {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0.5rem;
    }

    .builder-skills-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .skill-badge {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .view-pass-btn {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      padding: 0.5rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    .view-pass-btn:hover {
      background: var(--c-magenta);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-magenta);
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 2: UNIAI STUDY COPILOT & 0G AI COMPUTE WALLET
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .copilot-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 340px;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .copilot-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    /* Terminal Interface */
    .terminal-container {
      background: #090D14;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 600px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-dark);
    }

    .terminal-header {
      background: #0E1420;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .terminal-dots {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.45rem;
    }

    .term-dot {
      width: 11px;
      height: 11px;
      border-radius: 50%;
    }

    .term-dot.red { background: #EF4444; }
    .term-dot.yellow { background: #F59E0B; }
    .term-dot.green { background: #10B981; }

    .terminal-title {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .terminal-body {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      overflow-y: auto;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: #38BDF8;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.85rem;
    }

    .term-msg {
      line-height: 1.6;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 0.65rem 0.95rem;
      max-width: 95%;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    .term-msg.user {
      align-self: flex-end;
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.35);
      color: #F8FAFC;
    }

    .term-msg.ai {
      align-self: flex-start;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: #E2E8F0;
    }

    .term-msg.system {
      align-self: center;
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.2rem;
    }

    .term-code-block {
      background: #04070B;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      margin: 0.5rem 0;
      color: #86EFAC;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    .copy-code-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0.4rem;
      right: 0.4rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.5rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .copy-code-btn:hover {
      background: var(--c-cyan);
      color: #030712;
    }

    /* Prompt Suggestion Chips */
    .prompt-chips-bar {
      padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;
      background: #090D14;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .prompt-chip {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .prompt-chip:hover {
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      border-color: var(--c-cyan);
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1);
    }

    /* Terminal Input Box */
    .terminal-input-bar {
      padding: 0.85rem 1.25rem;
      background: #0A0F1A;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .terminal-input-bar span {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .term-input-field {
      flex: 1;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      outline: none;
    }

    .term-send-btn {
      background: var(--c-cyan);
      color: #030712;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.45rem 1.15rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .term-send-btn:hover {
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--c-cyan);
      background: #22D3EE;
    }

    /* 0G AI Compute Wallet Widget */
    .wallet-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-dark);
    }

    .wallet-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .wallet-title {
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .balance-display {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.1), rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.1));
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass-bright);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.25rem;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .balance-number {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    .balance-unit {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .wallet-meter-wrap {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.4rem;
    }

    .meter-label-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    }

    .meter-bar {
      height: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 999px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .meter-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 82%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--c-cyan), var(--c-lime));
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: width 0.4s ease;
    }

    .claim-daily-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-lime), #65A30D);
      color: #030712;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      padding: 0.75rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-lime-glow);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .claim-daily-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.6);
    }

    .wallet-stats-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .wallet-stat-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    }

    .wallet-stat-row span:last-child {
      color: #fff;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 3: DAREDROP ARENA (6 Official Competition Dares)
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .arena-banner {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15), rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15));
      border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.35);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2.2rem;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.18);
    }

    .arena-banner::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -50%;
      left: -50%;
      width: 200%;
      height: 200%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
      pointer-events: none;
      animation: rotateGrad 20s linear infinite;
    }

    @keyframes rotateGrad {
      from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
      to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
    }

    .arena-tag {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--c-magenta);
      background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.4);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .active-dare-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3.2vw, 2.2rem);
      font-weight: 900;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .active-dare-desc {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    }

    .dare-timer-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .dare-countdown-chip {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
      border: 1px solid var(--c-gold);
      color: var(--c-gold);
      padding: 0.55rem 1.2rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-gold-glow);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .submit-proof-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-magenta), #BE185D);
      color: #fff;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 1rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.6rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--c-magenta-glow);
      transition: all 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }

    .submit-proof-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.7);
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F43F5E, var(--c-magenta));
    }

    /* 6 Official Dares Grid */
    .dares-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .dare-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.4rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.8rem;
      position: relative;
    }

    .dare-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-glass-bright);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .dare-card.current {
      border-color: var(--c-magenta);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-magenta-glow);
    }

    .dare-num-badge {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .dare-card-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .dare-card-desc {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .dare-card-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      margin-top: auto;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      padding-top: 0.75rem;
    }

    .dare-prize {
      color: var(--c-gold);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 4: CAMPUS STUDY VAULT (Arkiv Network & Swarm Storage)
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .vault-toolbar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 1.8rem;
    }

    .vault-search-box {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 280px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      padding: 0.65rem 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .vault-search-input {
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      color: #fff;
      width: 100%;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .vault-filter-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .filter-pill {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .filter-pill.active, .filter-pill:hover {
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      border-color: var(--c-cyan);
    }

    .upload-vault-btn {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), #0284C7);
      color: #030712;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.65rem 1.3rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-cyan-glow);
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .vault-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(350px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.3rem;
    }

    .vault-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.4rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .vault-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--border-glass-bright);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    }

    .vault-card-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }

    .vault-file-title {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .vault-ttl-tag {
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--c-lime);
      background: rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.12);
      border: 1px solid rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.3);
      padding: 0.2rem 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .vault-meta-list {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.25rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 0.6rem;
    }

    .vault-meta-item {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }

    .vault-card-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.65rem;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 0.5rem;
    }

    .vault-action-btn {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 0.55rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .vault-action-preview {
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.35);
      color: var(--c-cyan);
    }

    .vault-action-preview:hover {
      background: var(--c-cyan);
      color: #030712;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--c-cyan);
    }

    .vault-action-swarm {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
    }

    .vault-action-swarm:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      color: #fff;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 5: SPEEDLINK 1080p & REELS LIVE STAGE
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .speedlink-subtabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .speedlink-tab-btn {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      padding: 0.65rem 1.4rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .speedlink-tab-btn.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.25), rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.25));
      border-color: var(--c-cyan);
      color: #fff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    /* WebRTC Video Room */
    .video-room-container {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .video-room-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .video-tile {
      background: #090D14;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-dark);
    }

    .video-tile video {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .video-tile-fallback {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
    }

    .avatar-circle {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), var(--c-magenta));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    .video-overlay-info {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 0.85rem;
      left: 0.85rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .video-controls-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 1.2rem;
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    }

    .vid-ctrl-btn {
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .vid-ctrl-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    .vid-ctrl-next {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), #0284C7);
      color: #030712;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
      width: auto;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      gap: 0.4rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-cyan-glow);
    }

    /* Live P2P Text Chat inside SpeedLink */
    .speedlink-chat-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto 3rem;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .chat-messages-box {
      height: 140px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 0.85rem;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .chat-bubble {
      padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;
      border-radius: 6px;
      max-width: 80%;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .chat-bubble.peer {
      align-self: flex-start;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      color: #e2e8f0;
    }

    .chat-bubble.me {
      align-self: flex-end;
      background: rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(6, 182, 212, 0.35);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .chat-input-row {
      display: flex;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .chat-input-field {
      flex: 1;
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      padding: 0.65rem 1rem;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      outline: none;
    }

    .chat-send-btn {
      background: var(--c-cyan);
      color: #030712;
      border: none;
      padding: 0 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    /* Reels Vertical Live Stage */
    .reels-stage-wrap {
      max-width: 440px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    .reels-frame {
      background: #090D14;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: 28px;
      aspect-ratio: 9 / 16;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .reel-content-layer {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.65) 0%, transparent 40%, rgba(0,0,0,0.88) 100%);
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .reel-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .reel-live-badge {
      background: #EF4444;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.6);
    }

    .reel-footer {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .reel-creator-info {
      max-width: 75%;
    }

    .reel-creator-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .reel-caption {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: #E2E8F0;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .reel-side-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1.1rem;
    }

    .reel-action-btn {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      width: 44px;
      height: 44px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .reel-action-btn:hover {
      transform: scale(1.15);
      color: var(--c-magenta);
      border-color: var(--c-magenta);
    }

    .reel-nav-controls {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1rem;
    }

    .reel-switch-btn {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .reel-switch-btn:hover {
      background: var(--c-cyan);
      color: #030712;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-cyan);
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       SECTION 6: SAFETY & LEGAL FOOTER
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .safety-cards-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
      gap: 1.25rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    .safety-info-card {
      background: var(--bg-card);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      transition: all 0.25s ease;
    }

    .safety-info-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--c-magenta);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-magenta);
    }

    .safety-card-title {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
    }

    .safety-card-desc {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .safety-card-link {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      margin-top: auto;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .safety-card-link:hover {
      color: var(--c-magenta);
    }

    .app-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      background: #070A0F;
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .footer-links-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .footer-links-row a {
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 500;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }

    .footer-links-row a:hover {
      color: var(--c-cyan);
    }

    .contact-desk-pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.3);
      padding: 0.4rem 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--radius-full);
      color: #fff;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .contact-desk-pill a {
      color: var(--c-magenta);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       MODALS (APK Download, World ID, Proof Submission, PDF Viewer, Pass)
       ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
    .modal-backdrop {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(3, 7, 18, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
      z-index: 1000;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 1.5rem;
      animation: modalFade 0.25s ease;
    }

    .modal-backdrop.active {
      display: flex;
    }

    @keyframes modalFade {
      from { opacity: 0; }
      to { opacity: 1; }
    }

    .modal-box {
      background: #0E1420;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass-bright);
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      padding: 2rem;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 520px;
      box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
      position: relative;
    }

    .modal-close-btn {
      position: absolute;
      top: 1.25rem;
      right: 1.25rem;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border: none;
      color: var(--c-text-muted);
      width: 32px;
      height: 32px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 1rem;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }

    .modal-close-btn:hover {
      color: #fff;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
    }

    .modal-title {
      font-size: 1.35rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .modal-subtitle {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    /* 3D Holographic Lanyard Pass */
    .lanyard-pass-container {
      perspective: 1000px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .lanyard-card {
      width: 290px;
      height: 420px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #161F30, #0B101D);
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border-glass-bright);
      border-radius: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px var(--c-cyan-glow);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease-out;
    }

    .lanyard-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      top: -100%;
      left: -100%;
      width: 300%;
      height: 300%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15) 0%, transparent 40%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.2) 60%, transparent 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .pass-clip-hole {
      width: 48px;
      height: 10px;
      background: #000;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
    }

    .pass-avatar {
      width: 78px;
      height: 78px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--c-cyan), var(--c-magenta));
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--c-cyan-glow);
      margin-bottom: 0.85rem;
    }

    .pass-name {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .pass-college {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      color: var(--c-cyan);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }

    .pass-details-box {
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--c-text-secondary);
      text-align: left;
      margin-top: auto;
    }

    /* Proof video recording box */
    .proof-video-box {
      width: 100%;
      height: 220px;
      background: #000;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
    }

    .proof-video-box video {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    .zk-laser-scanner {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--c-cyan), transparent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--c-cyan);
      animation: laserScan 2s infinite ease-in-out;
      display: none;
    }

    @keyframes laserScan {
      0% { top: 0%; opacity: 0; }
      20% { opacity: 1; }
      80% { opacity: 1; }
      100% { top: 98%; opacity: 0; }
    }

    /* PDF Viewer Modal Specific */
    .pdf-modal-box {
      max-width: 820px;
      height: 80vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .pdf-mock-canvas {
      flex: 1;
      background: #111827;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 2rem;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    /* Responsive adjustments */
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .navbar { padding: 0.75rem 1rem; }
      .nav-tabs { display: none; }
      .mobile-tabs-bar {
        display: flex;
        position: fixed;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        background: rgba(13, 17, 23, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border-glass);
        z-index: 100;
        justify-content: space-around;
        padding: 0.5rem 0.25rem;
      }
      .mobile-tab-btn {
        background: transparent;
        border: none;
        color: var(--c-text-muted);
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.2rem;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .mobile-tab-btn.active {
        color: var(--c-cyan);
      }
      .tab-section { padding-bottom: 6rem; }
    }

    @media (min-width: 769px) {
      .mobile-tabs-bar { display: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Cyber Toast Notification Container -->
  <div id="toast-container"></div>

  <!-- Ambient 120fps Background Particle Canvas -->
  <canvas id="ambient-canvas"></canvas>

  <div class="app-wrapper">
    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         NAVBAR
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <header class="navbar">
      <a href="#hero" class="nav-brand" onclick="switchTab('hero')">
        <div class="brand-logo-glow">🌌</div>
        <div>
          <div class="brand-title">Newton's Lobby</div>
          <div class="brand-subtitle">The Campus OS & AI Trust Layer</div>
        </div>
      </a>

      <nav class="nav-tabs">
        <button class="nav-tab-btn active" data-tab="hero" onclick="switchTab('hero')">🚀 Dashboard</button>
        <button class="nav-tab-btn" data-tab="copilot" onclick="switchTab('copilot')">🤖 UniAI Copilot</button>
        <button class="nav-tab-btn" data-tab="arena" onclick="switchTab('arena')">🎯 DareDrop Arena</button>
        <button class="nav-tab-btn" data-tab="vault" onclick="switchTab('vault')">📚 Study Vault</button>
        <button class="nav-tab-btn" data-tab="speedlink" onclick="switchTab('speedlink')">📹 SpeedLink & Reels</button>
        <button class="nav-tab-btn" data-tab="safety" onclick="switchTab('safety')">🛡️ Safety</button>
      </nav>

      <div class="nav-actions">
        <button class="audio-toggle-btn" id="audio-toggle-btn" title="Toggle Cyber Audio FX" onclick="toggleAudioFX()">🔊</button>
        <button class="connect-world-btn" id="nav-world-btn" onclick="openWorldIdModal()">
          <span>🌐 Verify World ID</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Mobile Floating Bottom Navigation -->
    <div class="mobile-tabs-bar">
      <button class="mobile-tab-btn active" data-tab="hero" onclick="switchTab('hero')"><span>🚀</span>Dash</button>
      <button class="mobile-tab-btn" data-tab="copilot" onclick="switchTab('copilot')"><span>🤖</span>Copilot</button>
      <button class="mobile-tab-btn" data-tab="arena" onclick="switchTab('arena')"><span>🎯</span>DareDrop</button>
      <button class="mobile-tab-btn" data-tab="vault" onclick="switchTab('vault')"><span>📚</span>Vault</button>
      <button class="mobile-tab-btn" data-tab="speedlink" onclick="switchTab('speedlink')"><span>📹</span>Live</button>
      <button class="mobile-tab-btn" data-tab="safety" onclick="switchTab('safety')"><span>🛡️</span>Safety</button>
    </div>

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         SECTION 1: HERO & AGENTIC DASHBOARD
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
    <main>
      <section id="section-hero" class="tab-section active">
        <div class="hero-container">
          <div class="hero-eyebrow">
            <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
            <span>MAINNET LIVE • ORB-VERIFIED ZERO-KNOWLEDGE TRUST LAYER</span>
          </div>

          <h1 class="hero-title">
            Newton's Lobby<br>
            <span class="hero-highlight">The Campus OS & AI Trust Layer</span>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-subtitle">
            Autonomous university builder network, zero-knowledge 0G AI compute, sybil-resistant World ID 4.0 proofs, and 30-day time-scoped Arkiv DB-Chain persistence.
          </p>

          <!-- Live Web3 Status Badges -->
          <div class="web3-badges-grid">
            <div class="web3-badge-card card-cyan" onclick="openWorldIdModal()" style="cursor: pointer;">
              <div class="badge-card-header">
                <div class="badge-icon-title">
                  <span>🌐</span> World ID 4.0
                </div>
                <span class="status-tag verified" id="badge-world-tag">Orb Verified</span>
              </div>
              <div class="badge-card-detail">app_23a9...1d93 • Sybil-Proof</div>
            </div>

            <div class="web3-badge-card card-lime" onclick="switchTab('copilot')" style="cursor: pointer;">
              <div class="badge-card-header">
                <div class="badge-icon-title">
                  <span>⚡</span> 0G Private ZK
                </div>
                <span class="status-tag live">0gm-1.0</span>
              </div>
              <div class="badge-card-detail">ZK Enclave Active • 18ms</div>
            </div>

            <div class="web3-badge-card card-magenta" onclick="switchTab('vault')" style="cursor: pointer;">
              <div class="badge-card-header">
                <div class="badge-icon-title">
                  <span>⛓️</span> Arkiv DB-Chain
                </div>
                <span class="status-tag active">@arkiv-sdk</span>
              </div>
              <div class="badge-card-detail">0x3F89...C0F4D • 30d TTL</div>
            </div>

            <div class="web3-badge-card card-gold" onclick="switchTab('vault')" style="cursor: pointer;">
              <div class="badge-card-header">
                <div class="badge-icon-title">
                  <span>🐝</span> Swarm Storage
                </div>
                <span class="status-tag live">1,428 Nodes</span>
              </div>
